db error: ERROR: query rejected: this query would read from object storage
DETAIL: Query policy "no_persist" rule "memory_only" applies to this query on cluster "quickstart".
HINT: Run EXPLAIN to inspect the query plan. Create an index that serves the query on this cluster, or use a cluster whose query policy permits this plan.

# This is a slow-path persist read, not a persist fast path.
query error query rejected: this query would read from object storage
SELECT a, sum(b) FROM unindexed GROUP BY a;

